    {
      "name": "dsh-hfsy-studio",
      "title": {
        "en": "HFSY Image Studio",
        "zh": "HFSY 生图工作台"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A full-page studio inside DSH for OpenAI-compatible image/video relays: prompt panel with per-model prices, result gallery with lightbox and downloads, per-day local output folder and persistent history. Video goes through the relay's async task API and bills per second.",
        "zh": "在 DSH 里开一个全屏工作台调用 OpenAI 兼容的中转出图/出片：左侧参数（模型下拉带单价、尺寸、质量、数量、画风预设），右侧结果画廊（灯箱、下载、复制落盘路径）与历史记录；视频按秒计费、走异步任务接口，出图出片都按日期落到本地目录。"
      },
